Z||000000||85ZainoGT||09-23-2001||12:37 PM||||heres the convo.<P><BR>officer: How are you doing tonight?<BR>  ME: not to bad  <BR>officer: Do you know why I pulled you over son?<BR>  ME: Probably because I was speeding<BR>officer: your right, can I see your license?<BR>  ME: Here you go.<BR>officer: is that one of them 6 cyl fieros<BR>  ME: Yes it is.<BR>Officer:Those are fast little suckers arent they.<BR>  ME: yes they are.<BR>Officer:I used to have one back when I was in High School.<BR>  ME: oh really?  what year.<BR>Officer: 87 gt<BR>  ME: ohh a fastback.. thats what im lookin for right now.<BR>officer: alright son well lets jus not speed anymore<BR>  ME:  ok, thanks<BR>   <P>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  im never getting rid of my fiero!  I was racing a bonneville when this happened...  ||||reg||1
