Z||000005||8Ball||09-23-2001||04:06 PM||||I have alot of friends who are Police officers, and a couple who are TBI and FBI.<BR>I realize officers get a bad wrap because people get tickets for doing stupid stuff or what not. But I think people really need to look at it this way. Is an officer a bad guy if he gives you a ticket when you were say doing 10 or 15 over the limit? I speed from time to time as well. But if I get a ticket I am not going to curse the officer either to his face or behind his back. The police are really our friends and they are here to help us. Without them we would all do outrageous speeds and our cars and possibly lives would be trashed.<P>I am not hammering on anyone, I am mearly asking for some understanding on the side of the Police. They risk their lives for us everyday and we as a whole mearly write them off as overpaid obnoxious jerks rather than the underpaid hero's that they are.<P>Randy Walker||||reg||1
